  "prefLabel": "He-P 3306.02 Monitoring Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3306.02 Monitoring Procedures. The department shall establish monitoring procedures for each farmer’s compliance history by including one or more of the following in accordance with past violations to ensure current compliance with 7 CFR 248.10(e):\n\n(a) Review of farmer participation, transaction history, and related correspondence;\n\n(b) Overt or covert observation of farmer compliance with program requirements;\n\n(c) Interviews with farmer staff involved with FMNP operations;\n\n(d) Review of farmer pricing; and\n\n(e) FMNP recipient contact to verify purchases.\n\nSource. #14200, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p3300.html"
}
